UnitPool::PendingFees
├── when account has no liquidity
│   └── it should return stored claimable amounts
├── when account has no liquidity and stale indexes
│   └── it should ignore index deltas
├── when account has liquidity and no new fee index
│   └── it should return stored claimable amounts
├── when account has liquidity and only token0 accrued
│   └── it should include the token0 index delta
├── when account has liquidity and only token1 accrued
│   └── it should include the token1 index delta
├── when account has liquidity and both tokens accrued
│   └── it should include stored claimable amounts and both index deltas
└── when accrual rounds down
    └── it should return the rounded down pending fees
